  "details": "As of posting there is a minor bug with regards to avatar audio and ear muff mode. For some avatars, they normally tie the volume/pitch adjustment with a float to multiply by in the animator. With this in mind if the audio source is active/enabled all the time it will ignore the floats and the audio will play at normal volume/pitch. I'm not honestly sure why but here is a video showing the issue https://twitter.com/Smash_ter/status/1638343584461070346",
